WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
Trace a smooth-edged 12 mm craft mirror.
Set it inside the circle.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:08.800
Stitch three vertical threads over the mirror.
Anchor both ends of each thread just beyond the rim.

00:00:08.800 --> 00:00:11.650
Weave the first row over, under, then over
the three vertical threads.

00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.500
For the middle row, weave under, over, then under.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.900
Repeat over, under, over on the last row.
Keep the grid snug and secure the thread at the back.

00:00:17.900 --> 00:00:24.400
Make a ring of short Aari chain stitches
in the fabric just outside the mirror.

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:27.000
Join the last loop to the first and secure the thread.
Gently nudge the mirror to check it stays centred.
